id: pm-github-pr-url-alias-followup
title: Exclude PR owners in every supported explicit URL field during refresh
description: "Review follow-up from PR #233 thread PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM62Q99D: identity resolution recognizes GitHubURL aliases, while refresh PR exclusion checks github_url only. Evaluate all supported explicit URL fields before the issue-only GraphQL query. Separate from round-4 durable-state publication; retain real tracker tests for aliases and issue owners."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 3
tags[1]: review-followup
