updated_at: "2026-11-14T10:07:20.063Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-14T08:55:15.604Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-13T17:13:15.000Z"
author: codex-github230-1111
release: 2026.11.14
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-11T20:20:11.029Z",codex-github230-1111,"Round 5 centralizes recognized explicit URL aliases in explicitGithubIdentities and makes ownership matching and refresh consume the same parsed kind. Five real SDK alias scenarios verify PRs are excluded before querying, canonical PR controls stay excluded, issue aliases still refresh, and curated titles stay unchanged. The selector/model also checks all 1024 case/optional-underscore spellings. Focused Node/Bun files pass 30/30; full gates and reverts remain in progress."
  "2026-11-11T21:06:56.712Z",codex-github230-1111,"Round 5 completed: explicitGithubIdentities shares every recognized URL alias and parsed kind between import ownership and refresh PR selection. Five real SDK tracker scenarios cover retained aliases, canonical PR controls, issue aliases and unchanged curated titles; the selector also checks all 1024 accepted case/optional-underscore spellings. Linked node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern \"^Refresh excludes PRs\" test/github-url.test.ts passes 5/5. Reverting only the selector makes all 5 fail; restored Node/Bun file passes 31/31. Evidence maps to PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM62Q99D. Releasing this author claim and leaving the item in progress."
  "2026-11-12T08:53:53.065Z",codex-github230-1111,"Round 9 tracker audit: moved the parent issue or PR reference from a gh tag to a docs link. This is reference hygiene only; deferred implementation remains out of scope and this item stays open."
  "2026-11-14T08:49:49.541Z",codex-sweep-1114,"2026-11-14 sweep: returned idle or paused work to open; no agent is actively working this item. Delivered slices: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/pull/233 merged 2026-11-13T17:13:15Z; merge SHA 5766ef01f8fff0b4dd2c1c07474b2d55636ab535; PR head a5f1cc1761ff4c2adcce8b98bb849648da668a02. Delivered: Exclude PR owners in every supported explicit URL field during refresh. Green at that head: test (22), codeql, test (26), bun-release (22), bun-release (26), CodeQL, CodeRabbit, Greptile Review, semgrep-cloud-platform/scan. Other check outcomes: verified-auto-merge: SKIPPED; audit-armed-requests: SKIPPED; cubic · AI code reviewer: NEUTRAL; Sourcery review: SKIPPED (not counted as green). Remaining: reconcile the deferred follow-up with the recorded alias-selector implementation and verify all explicit URL aliases against complete refresh acceptance; the latest handoff explicitly leaves this follow-up deferred/open."
  "2026-11-14T10:07:20.047Z",codex-sweep-1114,"Release-attribution correction: completed_at = 2026-11-13T17:13:15Z from https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/pull/233 (merge SHA 5766ef01f8fff0b4dd2c1c07474b2d55636ab535); first containing release tag v2026.11.14, recorded release 2026.11.14."
