close_reason: "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/pull/233 merged 2026-11-13T17:13:15Z; merge SHA 5766ef01f8fff0b4dd2c1c07474b2d55636ab535; PR head a5f1cc1761ff4c2adcce8b98bb849648da668a02. Delivered: Refresh excludes PR owners in every recognized explicit URL alias through the shared ownership kind parser; canonical PRs remain excluded and issue aliases still refresh without changing curated content. Green at that head: test (22), codeql, test (26), bun-release (22), bun-release (26), CodeQL, CodeRabbit, Greptile Review, semgrep-cloud-platform/scan. Other check outcomes: verified-auto-merge: SKIPPED; audit-armed-requests: SKIPPED; cubic · AI code reviewer: NEUTRAL; Sourcery review: SKIPPED (not counted as green). Current-main verification: node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern \"^Refresh excludes PRs\" test/github-url.test.ts passed 5/5 with no failures or skips. This implementation and its original scope supersede the contradictory generic deferred handoff and the earlier sweep reopening."
